Z||000000||87 Steve GT||02-20-2000||08:26 AM||||Well, with all the mirror turn signal talk really made some "light's" go off in my head.<P>I know that there will be some responces to this that are not favorable... lol  <P>What i did is take a 2" round standard brake light's... made a small bracket to mount them to. I put one just above my battery, and one just above my air cleaner(V6) wired them dierctly through my brake light's.... now I have "vent light's"....you can't see them at all during the day but, as you can only imagine them sucker's really glow at night... they look real cool if you pull up next to me at a light or something,cause you can actually see the light it self... it also work's off of my brake light.s too..... and i feel the best part is you CANNOT SEE THEM AT ALL FROM INSIDE...  i will post a pic next weekend.         Steve...||||reg||6
